      "bookmarked": false,
      "raw": "Hello everyone!\n\nMade this account to try and get some help running this RPG for my friends on FoundryVTT, as I was delighted to see that there was a ruleset made with somewhat automated character sheets. However, while most things seem to work, I cannot for the life of me get the dice pool auto rolling to work. \n\nWhen I select a power, quality, and status, it is supposed to roll the dice and display them in the chat, however nothing happens no matter what I do. Anyone have this issue and had any luck in fixing it?\n\nThanks!\n\nEDIT: I managed to solve it by reverting my Foundry game back to the last patch of V11, which seems to have fixed it!",
